taslak alCamist","alias":"Muhannad Taslaq Alchemist"},{"key":"muhanad taslak duha","alias":"Muhannad Taslaq Doha"},{"key":"muhanad tasluk","alias":"Muhannad Tasluq"}]},{"id":"ea3eef8e-952e-5a7e-8291-d790c5ff0e62","profileKey":"qa-demo-invest-qatar","entityKind":"GOVERNMENT_AGENCY","researchStatus":"PREPARED_PUBLIC_SEED","requiresRefresh":true,"displayName":"Invest Qatar","aliases":["Investment Promotion Agency Qatar","IPA Qatar","InvestQatar","Investment Promotion Agency","Invest in Qatar"],"profileUrl":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/investqatar/","role":null,"organization":null,"location":"Qatar","confidence":"STRONG","facts":[{"claim":"Invest Qatar is the Investment Promotion Agency Qatar, a government agency established in 2019 to attract foreign direct investment into Qatar. It is not a venture fund or an investor.","sourceIds":["S18","S22"],"evidenceClass":"MULTI_SOURCE_SUPPORTED","topic":"IDENTITY","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"What it does for investors: information on sectors and opportunities, introductions to government entities and key players, partner matching, business-service referrals, and business-setup support with the licensing platforms.","sourceIds":["S18"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"WHAT_THEY_DO","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Its Chief Executive Officer is Sheikh Ali Alwaleed Al-Thani, as shown on its About page.","sourceIds":["S18"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"ROLE","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"On 23 June 2026 it launched a Venture Capital Funding Module on the Invest Qatar Gateway with Qatar Investment Authority: startups can review participating QIA-backed funds, check their criteria and submit pitches to fund managers. The agency connects founders to funds; the funds decide.","sourceIds":["S19"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"ARTICLE","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":"2026-06-23"},{"claim":"On 23 September 2026 it announced a strategic engagement with Aurion Capital and LG NOVA covering innovation programmes and scale-up support in AI, digital health, fintech, digital infrastructure, sports, and media, plus a planned hub in Qatar Science & Technology Park.","sourceIds":["S20"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"ARTICLE","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":"2026-09-23"},{"claim":"Its technology-sector page promotes Startup Qatar, an Invest Qatar initiative that is a single resource for startup support, funding and incubation programmes, grants and networking events.","sourceIds":["S21"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"PRIORITIES","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Priorities visible in its publications: attracting foreign investment, economic diversification, priority sectors such as AI, fintech and digital infrastructure, and a clear path from startups to QIA-backed funds.","sourceIds":["S18","S19","S20"],"evidenceClass":"SELF_REPORTED","topic":"PRIORITIES","status":"FACT_EXTRACTED","asOf":null}],"sources":[{"sourceId":"S18","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/about-us","description":"Invest Qatar official role as national investment-promotion agency","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"The Investment Promotion Agency Qatar (Invest Qatar) is responsible for overseeing investment promotion activities, aimed at attracting foreign direct investment into Qatar. Established in 2019 … We facilitate introductions between investors and government entities … We assist you in setting up your business … Chief Executive Officer, Investment Promotion Agency Qatar","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S19","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/media-centre/news-and-articles/invest-qatar-gateway-introduces-new-feature-connecting-startups-to-venture-capital-funds","description":"Invest Qatar Gateway VC Funding Module 23 June 2026","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"announced the launch of the Venture Capital (VC) Funding Module on the Invest Qatar Gateway, developed in collaboration with Qatar Investment Authority (QIA) … submit their pitches directly to fund managers … many of which are backed by QIA through its $3 billion Fund of Funds programme","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official press release read 2026-10-11 (23 June 2026)."},{"sourceId":"S20","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/media-centre/news-and-articles/invest-qatar-aurion-capital-and-lg-nova-engage-to-advance-technology-investments","description":"Invest Qatar emerging technologies partnership 23 September 2026","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"a strategic engagement with Aurion Capital, a global investment group, and LG NOVA … artificial intelligence (AI), digital health, financial technologies (FinTech), digital infrastructure, sports, media and entertainment … Qatar offers international investors a gateway to the MENA region and a natural pathway for sustainable regional expansion.","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official press release read 2026-10-11 (23 September 2026)."},{"sourceId":"S21","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/sectors-and-opportunities/technology","description":"Invest Qatar technology-sector investment opportunities","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Startup Qatar, an initiative by Invest Qatar, is a single comprehensive resource for information, support, and opportunities offered to startups.","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official sector page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S22","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/investqatar/","description":"Invest Qatar official LinkedIn page","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Investment Promo