CE_SUPPORTED","topic":"IDENTITY","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Its stated purpose is to be the Gulf's leading Sharia-compliant asset manager and corporate advisory firm; its values are People, Trust, Excellence and Sharia.","sourceIds":["S23"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"PRIORITIES","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Asset management: public equities (Qatar and the Gulf), global sukuk and money markets; customised solutions for institutional and high-net-worth investors, with a focus on the GCC and Turkey. It manages the AlRayan GCC Fund and the AlRayan Qatar ETF (QATR).","sourceIds":["S23","S25"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"WHAT_THEY_DO","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Financial advisory: equity capital markets (IPOs, secondary offerings), debt capital markets (sukuk), M&A (buy-side and sell-side) and corporate finance (capital structure, restructuring).","sourceIds":["S24"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"WHAT_THEY_DO","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Its team page lists Akber Khan as Acting Chief Executive Officer, Zohaib Pervez as head of Asset Management (more than QAR5bn in client portfolios) and Hadi El Kadi as head of Financial Advisory.","sourceIds":["S27"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"ROLE","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null},{"claim":"Its site warns that entities are impersonating ARI, and says ARI has no lending licence.","sourceIds":["S23"],"evidenceClass":"DOCUMENT_SUPPORTED","topic":"ARTICLE","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","asOf":null}],"sources":[{"sourceId":"S23","url":"https://www.alrayan.com/en/investment-banking","description":"AlRayan Investment official overview","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Established in 2007 in Qatar, multi-award winning AlRayan Investment LLC (ARI) is a leading investment firm, focused on asset management and corporate advisory. … ARI is 100%-owned by AlRayan Bank (Masraf AlRayan QPSC). The firm is authorised by the QFC Regulatory Authority and regulated by the QFMA. … To be the Gulf’s leading Sharia-compliant asset manager and corporate advisory firm.","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S24","url":"https://www.alrayan.com/en/investment-banking/financial-advisory-group","description":"AlRayan Investment advisory services including capital markets and M&A","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Equity Capital Markets advisory: IPOs, secondary offerings … Debt Capital Markets advisory: General debt advisory, sukuk issuance & Placement. … Buy-side and sell-side advisory services for local and cross-border transactions","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S25","url":"https://www.alrayan.com/investment-banking/asset-management-group/about-asset","description":"AlRayan Investment asset management and Sharia-compliant funds","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"AlRayan Investment provides customised investment solutions to institutional and High Net Worth investors … AlRayan Investment manages AlRayan GCC Fund, the largest mutual fund based in Qatar and the largest Sharia-compliant GCC fund in the world. … ARI manages AlRayan Qatar ETF (ticker QATR)","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S26","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/al-rayan-investment-llc/","description":"AlRayan Investment LinkedIn organization profile","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Established in 2007 in Qatar, multi-award winning Al Rayan Investment LLC (ARI) is a leading investment firm … Specialties Asset Management and Corporate Financial Advisory